{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Order, and they also want nothing better than that one gets along with them in order. From here it goes over Abersau), Culm — the region of the Battle of Culm, through nothing but a succession of hills and fields — all cultivated and fertile — to Töplitz, which lies very beautifully and pleasantly. I lodged in a brand-new inn (one), because its sign is to the King of Prussia. — Today immediately to the Schlackenberg, which is opposite the inn, — Miss Stok had also recommended this route to me, — on this hill one overlooks the entire region around Töplitz, i.e. if one goes around the top of the hill; — an extremely pleasant view, — the very wide region — finally bounded by higher mountain ranges, — the most varied succession of hills, valleys, rows of houses — everything is most cheerful; — then drank the spring water in the hospital garden — one spring is eye-water, which did me great good — into the park, which belongs to the palace of Prince Clary, the lord of the region — then took a bath in the stone bath — a magnificent spring — then dined with appetite — I shall drive to the castle hill. —"}}],"created":1795219013,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":254,"prompt_tokens":376,"total_tokens":630,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-S5hQaiwj8CQxxOStnuJ0ERXLN1LlrNq9","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":376,"prompt_ms":496.308,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3199680851063829,"prompt_per_second":757.5940746471949,"predicted_n":254,"predicted_ms":5958.218,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.550268774703557,"predicted_per_second":42.46236039030462}}